Description: Comprehensive toolkit for synthetic control methods with advanced
    features including specification-curve analysis, 'xgboost' + 'SHAP'
    machine-learning analysis, and multiple inference procedures. The package
    provides functions for data preparation, model estimation, statistical
    inference (including placebo and bootstrap-based methods), and
    publication-ready visualizations. Supports multiple outcome models
    (OLS, Ridge, Lasso, Augmented Synthetic Control) and includes parallel
    processing capabilities for large-scale specification-curve analysis.
    Methods references include Abadie et al. (2010) <doi:10.1198/jasa.2009.ap08746>,
    Abadie (2021) <doi:10.1257/jel.20191450>, and Chen and Guestrin (2016)
    <doi:10.1145/2939672.2939785>.
